   Technol},
Abstract = {This paper discusses a firm's performance of proactive environmental
   technology innovation strategy and reactive strategy based on the model.
   It is proved that a firm can get better payoff if the manager interpret
   environmental issues as opportunities, comparing the performance of
   achieving these two strategies. A firm can profit under better
   communications with the public by managerial interpretations of
   environmental issues as opportunities trading off the increasing costs.
   In conclusion, the shareholder should motivate the manager to interpret
   environmental issues as opportunities for better payoff.},
